en more mysteries and hidden object scenes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/495110/extras/3a916bc0c186961d7e70bbeb4f059b94.webp?t=1584611469\" width=231 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The ultimate hidden object adventure begins!<br></li><li>43 hand drawn locations full of Ho scenes!<br></li><li>Exciting 25 mini games and puzzles set in Karakorum Mountains!<br></li><li>Fantastic detective story rich in eerie mysteries!<br></li><li>More mini games and puzzles in bonus adventure! </li></ul>",
